# Perimeter Enforcer (1/1 flying, lifelink): "Whenever another Detective you control enters ... this creature gets +1/+1 until end
# of turn" (CR 603.6a, 611.2a). Bot1 casts it with Mox Pearl and Mox Jet on turn 1: it does not trigger on itself ("another"), still
# 1/1. Black Lotus then pays for Novice Inspector (a Detective: 2/2 for the turn) and, after a non-Detective Ornithopter changes
# nothing, Seasoned Consultant (another Detective: 3/3). On turn 2 the pumps are gone, and Bot2's own Novice Inspector entering
# under Bot2's control leaves it 1/1.

